{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:12.98] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:15.00] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:23.32] (TheBeatAsylum)\n[00:23.74] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:24.56] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:25.82] Yeah, I like that (Joey Rock Marley)\n[Chorus]\n[00:27.80] Ballin' like prime time\n[00:28.60] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[00:29.98] Girl, I really can't get you off my mind\n[00:32.70] It's been a while since we last spoke, funny how time flies\n[00:36.54] I don't really like how time flies\n[00:39.16] I remember when I was a good guy, now she think that I'm a bad guy\n[00:42.94] I was just caught up in the fast life\n[00:45.22] I remember I was taking my time, felt like I was in the past life\n[Verse 1]\n[00:49.12] I'm in my prime, bae, ain't taking my time, no, I ain't taking my time\n[00:55.30] All in my mind, bae, all in my mind, you're still all in my mind\n[01:01.60] I've been out of my mind, I've been out of my mind\n[01:05.88] Feeling like I'm running out of time\n[01:08.40] Feeling like I'm living a lie\n[01:10.20] I've been out of my mind, bae\n[Bridge]\n[01:13.66] Drugs getting harder to find\n[01:15.74] Maybe it's a sign of the times, bae\n[01:22.06] I've been out of my mind\n[Chorus]\n[01:25.76] Ballin' like prime time\n[01:27.48] Girl, I'm really trying to get you on my time\n[01:30.50] Girl, I really can't get you off my mind\n[01:33.30] It's been a while since we last spoke, funny how time flies\n[01:37.08] I don't really like how time flies\n[01:39.72] I remember when I was a good guy, now she think that I'm a bad guy\n[01:43.46] I was just caught up in the fast life\n[01:45.74] I remember I was taking my time, felt like I was in the past life\n[Interlude]\n[01:50.16] So this part, I'm finna breathe, you can like cut my voice out and shit\n[01:52.36] (Drink more water, styrofoam with the soda)\n[01:54.88] (Drink more water, styrofoam with the soda)\n[01: